      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"worst-case scenario\" seems doable, but the real problem is that even when we follow the numbers, things just seem to go missing or get stuck for no reason. like, the data says something should be here, but it's just... gone or delayed indefinitely. how do you account for those \"black swan\" events that don't show up in the historical standard deviation?",
